From 18c30494fc13ddc85ccd64f0621efd219f0200ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:27:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] test(golden): regenerate the Doosan DNM contour NC
 goldens the #689 arc fit moved

nc/doosan-dnm/contour_disc_hole.nc and contour_tangential_lead.nc (the
dialect merged after this branch's base): the same R6 bore ring change as
the other dialects - the closing chord becomes an arc and the lead-out
